<title>GERMANY: West German Q3 GDP rises 0.5 pct - Econ ministry.</title>
<headline>West German Q3 GDP rises 0.5 pct - Econ ministry.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Economics Ministry reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>W.GERMAN GDP	 Q3 96	 Q2 96	 Q1 96</p>
<p> qtr/qtr	     +0.5	  +1.0	  unch</p>
<p>E.GERMAN GDP</p>
<p> qtr/qtr	     +1.5	  +5.5(+5.0)  -3.0(-3.5)</p>
<p>NOTE - Quarter-on-quarter figures are adjusted for inflation (1991 prices) and for seasonal and calendar factors. They are rounded to the nearest half pct point. The Federal Statistics Office earlier gave the bulk of the third quarter GDP figures.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
